# local-overlay.resc — local fixes on top of the stock H743 platform.
#
# Include AFTER `machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32h743.repl`,
# with the repo root as the CWD:
#   include @renode/platforms/local-overlay.resc
#
#  1. DMA1/DMA2 become STM32DMA_ClearsEnable, so DMA-backed awaits complete
#     (local-dma.repl). A typed peripheral cannot be redeclared, so the
#     stock instances are unregistered first.
#  2. SPI1 becomes a real STM32H7_SPI with its RX DMA request (local-spi1.repl).
#
# @-paths try the Renode install first and fall back to the CWD (renode/README.md,
# ".renode-root"). The install has no renode/ directory, so
# these file names cannot be shadowed. Neither $CWD nor $ORIGIN is expanded
# inside an @-path in 1.16.1.

include @renode/platforms/STM32DMA_ClearsEnable.cs
machine UnregisterFromParent sysbus.dma1
machine UnregisterFromParent sysbus.dma2
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platforms/local-dma.repl
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platforms/local-spi1.repl
